//@version=6
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//                            S T R I K E   C O R E
//                     Two signal engines for Indian index options
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
//  Apply to an OPTION chart — Nifty, Bank Nifty, FinNifty, Sensex or Bankex,
//  CE or PE. Not to an index or futures chart: the targets are in option
//  premium points, and the lot size is read from the option's symbol.
//
//  ── TWO ENGINES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//      STRIKE RATE   the core engine. Eight internal signals; a marker prints
//                    when the number you choose agree. An optional switch adds
//                    one more condition: a second, faster trend read on the
//                    index must already agree and have held it for a few bars.
//      SR TREND      a directional ribbon with its own entries and exits.
//
//  Each has its own switch, so run either or both. Every entry is graded by how
//  many engines agree at that moment — one dot or two.
//
//  ── TELLING THEM APART ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//  Each engine carries three independent identifiers, so you always know which
//  one acted even when both fire on the same bar at almost the same price:
//
//      STRIKE RATE   blue    ▲ triangle   solid lines    label nearest the bar
//      SR TREND      green   ◆ diamond    dashed lines   label above that
//
//  Entries, targets and the exit tag all carry the engine's colour. Both engines
//  hold their own levels on the chart, so a second open position is never
//  hidden behind the first.
//
//  A STOP IS NEVER THE ENGINE'S COLOUR, on either engine. A stop is the one
//  line you cannot afford to misread, so it does not join the colour scheme that
//  tells the engines apart. On every theme but Mono it is red; Mono is
//  monochrome by design and there a stop is told apart by weight and by its tag,
//  not by hue. Which engine a stop belongs to is carried by its line style and
//  by the tag at its right end.
//
//  Labels sit in reserved lanes spaced by ATR, so two entries half a point apart
//  cannot land on top of each other, on a 50-rupee option or an 800-rupee one.
//
//  ── ONE TARGET ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//  Target 1 closes the whole trade. There is no partial booking, no stop that
//  moves to your entry, and no break-even outcome. Every trade ends exactly one
//  of four ways: the target, the stop, an opposite signal, or the bell.
//
//  In premium points, scaled to the instrument (the figures below are Nifty;
//  Bank Nifty is 2.5x, Sensex 2x, and the panel always prints the ones in force):
//
//      TAG  +10   a mark, nothing is sold. Confirmation the trade is moving.
//      T1   +25   the target. It closes the position in full. Trade complete.
//      SL   -25   the stop. It never moves.
//
//  WHY 25 AND 25, AND WHAT ELSE IS OFFERED. A target may not be smaller than the
//  stop it is paired with: 20 against a 25 stop has to be right 55.6% of the time
//  merely to stand still, and you pay that handicap on every trade. Two other
//  pairs are in the settings. Measured on 155 signals after Indian costs and
//  0.35 points of slippage:
//
//      25 and 25   Rs 217 a trade   stopped cold on 25.8%   <- default
//      20 and 25   Rs 161 a trade   stopped cold on 24.5%
//      30 and 30   Rs 258 a trade   stopped cold on 18.1%
//
//  Nothing tighter is offered, because nothing tighter made money on the same
//  sample. A tight stop does not protect you on an option; it pays the spread
//  more often.
//
//  THIS REPLACED A THREE-RUNG LADDER, and the reason is worth stating plainly
//  because it is the opposite of what most people expect. Booking a third at
//  each of +20, +30 and +50, with the stop lifted to entry after the first,
//  earned a fifth less than a single full exit on the same 155 signals, and
//  bought three percentage points fewer of the stops that hurt in exchange. It
//  also made the chart hard to read: a profitable trade whose REMAINDER
//  scratched at entry printed a red "stop loss" label. Both problems had the
//  same cause and both are gone.
//
//  (The ladder comparison is quoted as a RATIO, not in rupees, because it was
//  measured with a different exit model from the three-pair table above — the
//  table models the opposite-signal exit and the ladder run did not. Quoting
//  both in rupees made two different measurements look like one, and they did
//  not add up. The ratio is the part that is comparable.)
//
//  HOW FAR IT RAN AFTER YOU WERE OUT. Once the target has closed the trade, the
//  chart keeps watching and draws a hollow mark if the move carried on to +10
//  or +25 beyond your exit. These book nothing and change no number anywhere.
//  They are feedback, not a mistake: the exit rule was chosen KNOWING it gives
//  those up. Switch them off in the settings if they distract you.
//
//  TIME DECAY IS WHY THE TARGETS ARE WHAT THEY ARE. An option bleeds premium
//  every day the index stands still - measured at roughly 6 points a day across
//  ATM front-expiry contracts generally, and nearer 13 in the last week before
//  expiry, where decay accelerates. A target that needs all day to arrive is
//  paying that bill the whole way.
//
//  ── ON THE CHART ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//      #n      every mark carries its trade's number — the entry, the TAG, the
//              exit and the reach marks — so nothing is ambiguous when two
//              engines are live at once, and an exit can always be tied back to
//              the entry that opened it
//      ▲       entry, with the fill price, in the engine's colour
//      ◆ TAG   +10 reached
//      ✓ T1    the target. The trade is closed and complete.
//      ✕ SL    stopped out
//      ▼ EXIT  closed by an opposite signal
//      ▼ EOD   closed at the bell
//      ↗ T2    after the close, the move ran on this far. Nothing was sold.
//      ↗ T3    and this far. Also just a mark.
//
//  A solid, filled mark is money you made. A hollow, dashed one is a level the
//  move reached without you, and it only ever appears on a trade that CLOSED AT
//  ITS TARGET — a stopped-out trade is never given one.
//
//  The level lines appear on entry and are removed on exit, so the chart carries
//  no lines when you are flat. The entry and exit labels, the TAG and any reach
//  marks stay where they happened: they are the record of the day, and they are
//  capped so they cannot crowd out a live trade's own levels.
//
//  ── BEFORE YOU TRADE IT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//  Signals confirm on the CLOSE of a bar. An intrabar marker can still vanish.
//
//  Targets and stops are levels, not fills. Option premiums gap, and spreads
//  widen exactly when you most want out — budget for a fill worse than the line.
//
//  No indicator is a forecast. This one states its levels in advance and marks
//  what happened; position sizing and the decision to take a trade are yours.
//
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
indicator("STRIKE CORE", "CORE", overlay = true, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 500, max_bars_back = 2000)

gE     = "Engines"
useSR  = input.bool(true,  "Strike Rate", group = gE)
useTR  = input.bool(true,  "SR Trend", group = gE)

gS     = "Targets"
gN     = "Daily limit"
tagOn  = input.bool(true, "Mark the first move in your favour", group = gS)
rchOn  = input.bool(true, "Show how far it ran after the exit", group = gS)
tagP   = input.int(10, "  mark distance", minval = 3, maxval = 50, group = gS)
capMode = input.string("Shared across engines", "Count the limit", options = ["Shared across engines", "Separately for each engine"], group = gN)
maxDay = input.string("3", "Max entries per day", options = ["2", "3", "5", "No limit"], group = gN)
undSym = input.symbol("NSE:NIFTY1!", "Index feed", group = gE)

isBN   = str.contains(syminfo.ticker, "BANKNIFTY") or str.contains(syminfo.ticker, "BANKEX")
isFN   = str.contains(syminfo.ticker, "FINNIFTY")
isSX   = str.contains(syminfo.ticker, "SENSEX")
isMC   = str.contains(syminfo.ticker, "MIDCPNIFTY")
isNN   = str.contains(syminfo.ticker, "NIFTYNXT50")
lotSz  = isBN ? 30 : isFN ? 60 : isSX ? 20 : isMC ? 120 : isNN ? 25 : 65
ptSc   = isBN ? 2.5 : isSX ? 2.0 : 1.0

exitAll = true
tgtPair = input.string("25 and 25", "Target and stop", options = ["25 and 25", "20 and 25", "30 and 30"], group = gS, tooltip = "⚠ How far the trade aims, and how far it is allowed to go against you, in premium points — scaled to the index, so Bank Nifty and Sensex get proportionally wider numbers.\n\nTarget 1 CLOSES THE WHOLE TRADE. There is no partial booking and no break-even.\n\nMeasured on 155 signals, after costs and slippage:\n\n  25 and 25   Rs 217 a trade   stopped cold on 25.8%\n  20 and 25   Rs 161 a trade   stopped cold on 24.5%\n  30 and 30   Rs 258 a trade   stopped cold on 18.1%\n\n25 and 25 is the default and is the one to leave alone unless you have a reason. It is the smallest target that is not smaller than its own stop: a 20-point target against a 25-point stop has to be right 55.6% of the time just to break even, and you pay that handicap on every trade.\n\n30 and 30 earned the most and was stopped least, because a 25-point stop sits inside the contract's own noise more often than a 30 does. It also risks Rs 1,950 a lot instead of Rs 1,625, and the difference from 25/25 is inside the error bars on this sample. Pick it for fewer stop-outs, not because it is proven better.\n\nWhat is NOT here, deliberately: any target under 20 and any stop under 20. Every one of them lost money on the same sample. A tight stop does not protect you on an option; it just pays the spread more often.")
tp1p   = math.round(ptSc * (tgtPair == "20 and 25" ? 20.0 : tgtPair == "30 and 30" ? 30.0 : 25.0))
tp2p   = tp1p + math.round(ptSc * 10.0)
tp3p   = tp1p + math.round(ptSc * 25.0)
tagPts = math.round(ptSc * tagP)
slp    = math.round(ptSc * (tgtPair == "30 and 30" ? 30.0 : 25.0))

g1       = "Strike Rate"
mode     = input.string("Sniper", "Mode", options = ["Sniper", "Scanner"], group = g1)
chartSig = input.string("Any two must agree", "Chart signals from", options = ["Any two must agree", "Any one may print"], group = g1)
tfMode   = input.string("Follow the chart", "Chart timeframe", options = ["Follow the chart", "1 minute", "3 minute", "5 minute"], group = g1)

tfRaw    = timeframe.isminutes ? timeframe.multiplier : timeframe.isseconds ? 0 : 999
tfAuto   = tfMode == "Follow the chart"
tfPick   = tfRaw <= 2 ? 1 : tfRaw <= 4 ? 3 : 5
tf1      = tfAuto ? tfPick == 1 : tfMode == "1 minute"
tf3      = tfAuto ? tfPick == 3 : tfMode == "3 minute"
tfExact  = tfRaw == 1 or tfRaw == 3 or tfRaw == 5
sigUseTF = tf1 ? "1" : tf3 ? "3" : "5"

L_ATR  = tf1 ?  70 : tf3 ? 23 : 14
L_EMAF = tf1 ?  45 : tf3 ? 15 :  9
L_EMAM = tf1 ? 105 : tf3 ? 35 : 21
L_EMAS = tf1 ? 250 : tf3 ? 83 : 50
L_SLOPE= tf1 ?  15 : tf3 ?  5 :  3
L_FRESH= tf1 ?  15 : tf3 ?  5 :  3
L_BAND = tf1 ? 100 : tf3 ? 33 : 20
L_PIV  = tf1 ?  25 : tf3 ?  8 :  5
L_CONF = tf1 ? 100 : tf3 ? 33 : 20
L_HOLD = tf1 ?  30 : tf3 ? 10 :  6
L_STF  = tf1 ?  35 : tf3 ? 12 :  7
L_STS  = tf1 ?  50 : tf3 ? 17 : 10

tfWant = tf1 ? 1 : tf3 ? 3 : 5
tfHave = timeframe.in_seconds() / 60.0
tfOK   = tfAuto ? tfExact : tfWant == tfHave
tfSay  = tfAuto and tfExact ? str.tostring(tfWant) + " min  ·  auto" : tfAuto ? str.tostring(tfHave, "#.##") + " min  ·  using " + str.tostring(tfWant) + " min lengths" : tfOK ? tfMode + "  ·  pinned" : "PINNED " + tfMode + " ON A " + str.tostring(tfHave, "#.##") + " MIN CHART"

useConfirm = input.bool(false, "Confirm with trend before entry", group = g1)

g2      = "SR Trend"
trSpeed = input.string("Balanced", "Ribbon speed", options = ["Scalp", "Balanced", "Swing"], group = g2)
trTF    = input.timeframe("", "Ribbon timeframe", options = ["", "1", "3", "5", "15", "30", "60"], group = g2)

int   trHold  = tf1 ? 10 : tf3 ?  3 :  2
bool  trChop  = true
float trChopN = tf1 ? 0.067 : tf3 ? 0.117 : 0.15
int   trGap   = tf1 ? 15 : tf3 ?  5 :  3
float trStX   = 2.0
bool  trMark  = true
int   trMarkLen = 4

gD       = "Display"
showPnl  = input.bool(true, "Live panel", group = gD)
markOnly = input.bool(false, "Markers only — hide the band, the tint and the boxes", group = gD, tooltip = "⚠ A DISPLAY SWITCH ONLY. It changes nothing about how the indicator trades: the same entries fire at the same prices, the same targets and stops apply, and the alerts are identical. It only stops three things being painted over your candles.\n\nOFF (default)  the SR Trend band, the green wash while a trade is live, and the reward and risk boxes are all drawn.\nON             none of them are. You keep the entry markers, the target and TAG marks, the exit labels, the hollow reach marks and the panel.\n\nOnly the BAND belongs to SR Trend. The wash and the boxes appear whichever engine is holding, which is why this is one common switch rather than a control under each engine.\n\nOn a 1-minute option chart all three are drawn in premium points, and premium moves several percent a bar — so the band is often taller than the candles and the boxes can cover half the screen. If the chart is hard to read, this is the switch.\n\nThe Trend cloud setting below still works; this overrides it while it is on.")
showBoxIn = input.bool(true, "Position box", group = gD)
showStk  = input.bool(true, "Strike check", group = gD)
ribMode  = input.string("Light", "Trend cloud", options = ["Full", "Light", "Line only", "Off"], group = gD)
showBox = showBoxIn and not markOnly
bool trRib   = ribMode != "Off" and not markOnly
bool ribGlow = ribMode == "Full" and not markOnly
bool ribFill = (ribMode == "Full" or ribMode == "Light") and not markOnly
bool paint = false
theme    = input.string("Neon", "Theme", options = ["Neon", "Classic", "Mono", "High contrast"], group = gD)
mStyle   = input.string("Symbols", "Marker style", options = ["Symbols", "Text", "Minimal"], group = gD)
useStale = input.bool(false, "Stale-trade warning", group = gD)

staleN   = tf1 ? 150 : tf3 ? 50 : 30

showDay  = input.bool(true, "Session divider", group = gD)
showDiag = input.bool(false, "Signal diagnostics", group = gD)
bool tint  = not markOnly

bool showLbl = true

colUp = theme == "Classic" ? #26a69a : theme == "Mono" ? #d4d4d8 : theme == "High contrast" ? #00ff5f : #00ffaa
colDn = theme == "Classic" ? #ef5350 : theme == "Mono" ? #71717a : theme == "High contrast" ? #ff1744 : #ff2b47
colFl = theme == "Mono" ? #52525b : #7f8b9e
colTag = theme == "Mono" ? #d4d4d8 : theme == "High contrast" ? #ea80fc : #e879f9
colT1  = theme == "Mono" ? #a1a1aa : theme == "High contrast" ? #e040fb : #d946ef
colT2  = theme == "Mono" ? #71717a : theme == "High contrast" ? #d500f9 : #c026d3
colT3  = theme == "Mono" ? #52525b : theme == "High contrast" ? #aa00ff : #a21caf
colNu  = theme == "Mono" ? #3f3f46 : theme == "High contrast" ? #78909c : #52525b

cG  = colUp
cR  = colDn

f_chan(float v) => v <= 0.03928 ? v / 12.92 : math.pow((v + 0.055) / 1.055, 2.4)
f_ink(color c) =>
    float L = 0.2126 * f_chan(color.r(c) / 255.0) + 0.7152 * f_chan(color.g(c) / 255.0) + 0.0722 * f_chan(color.b(c) / 255.0)
    L > 0.1791 ? color.black : color.white

cSR = theme == "Mono" ? #e4e4e7 : theme == "High contrast" ? #00b0ff : #3d8bff
cTR = theme == "Mono" ? #a1a1aa : theme == "High contrast" ? #00c853 : #059669

cSTOP = colDn

tkr  = str.upper(syminfo.ticker)
aCE  = str.endswith(tkr, "CE") or not na(str.match(tkr, "[0-9]C[0-9]+$")) or str.contains(tkr, "CALL")
aPE  = str.endswith(tkr, "PE") or not na(str.match(tkr, "[0-9]P[0-9]+$")) or str.contains(tkr, "PUT")
isCE   = aCE ? true : aPE ? false : true
okType = aCE or aPE

newDay = ta.change(time("D")) != 0

[uO, uH, uL, uC, uV] = request.security(undSym, sigUseTF, [open, high, low, close, volume], barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)

uChart = request.security(undSym, timeframe.period, close, barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
dlN    = 60
dlK    = 10
dU     = uChart - nz(uChart[dlK], uChart)
dP     = close  - nz(close[dlK],  close)
dlSX   = math.sum(dU, dlN)
dlSY   = math.sum(dP, dlN)
dlSXX  = math.sum(dU * dU, dlN)
dlSXY  = math.sum(dU * dP, dlN)
dlDen  = dlN * dlSXX - dlSX * dlSX
dlRaw  = dlDen != 0 ? (dlN * dlSXY - dlSX * dlSY) / dlDen : na
dlEff  = dlRaw * (isCE ? 1.0 : -1.0)
dlTrav = math.sum(math.abs(dU), dlN)
dlOK   = bar_index >= dlN + dlK and not na(dlRaw) and dlTrav > 0 and dlEff > 0.02 and dlEff < 1.5
dO = uO
dH = uH
dL = uL
dC = uC
dV = nz(uV) <= 0 ? nz(volume) : uV

dTR  = math.max(dH - dL, math.max(math.abs(dH - nz(dC[1], dC)), math.abs(dL - nz(dC[1], dC))))
dAtr = ta.rma(dTR, L_ATR)
[pdH, pdL, pdC] = request.security(undSym, "D", [high[1], low[1], close[1]], barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_on)

var float cPV = 0.0
var float cV  = 0.0
dTyp = (dH + dL + dC) / 3
if newDay
    cPV := 0.0
    cV  := 0.0
cPV := cPV + nz(dTyp * dV)
cV  := cV + nz(dV)
refA = cV > 0 ? cPV / cV : dC

pP  = (pdH + pdL + pdC) / 3
pB0 = (pdH + pdL) / 2
pT0 = 2 * pP - pB0
pTC = math.max(pT0, pB0)
pBC = math.min(pT0, pB0)
pR1 = 2 * pP - pdL
pS1 = 2 * pP - pdH

f_conf(int len, float mult) =>
    b  = ta.sma(close, len)
    bd = ta.atr(len) * mult
    up = b + bd
    dn = b - bd
    var int d = 0
    if close > up
        d := 1
    else if close < dn
        d := -1
    fu   = d ==  1 and nz(d[1], 0) !=  1
    fd   = d == -1 and nz(d[1], 0) != -1
    held = nz(ta.barssince(fu or fd), 9999)
    [d, held]
[cDir, cHeld] = request.security(undSym, sigUseTF, f_conf(L_CONF, 1.2), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)
confOK = not useConfirm or (cDir == (isCE ? 1 : -1) and cHeld >= L_HOLD)

scanner = mode == "Scanner"
consN   = chartSig == "Any two must agree" ? 2 : 1
dIdx    = 8

var int   dayStart = na
var float orH = na
var float orL = na
var bool  orUp = false
var bool  orDn = false
if newDay
    dayStart := time
    orH      := dH
    orL      := dL
    orUp     := false
    orDn     := false
minsIn = na(dayStart) ? 0.0 : (time - dayStart) / 60000.0
inOR   = minsIn < 30
if inOR and not newDay
    orH := math.max(nz(orH, dH), dH)
    orL := math.min(nz(orL, dL), dL)
orDone = not inOR and not na(orH)
if orDone and dC > orH
    orUp := true
if orDone and dC < orL
    orDn := true

f_ax(h, l, c, fac, len) =>
    tr  = math.max(h - l, math.max(math.abs(h - nz(c[1], c)), math.abs(l - nz(c[1], c))))
    atr = ta.rma(tr, len)
    mid = (h + l) / 2
    ub  = mid + fac * atr
    lb  = mid - fac * atr
    var float fu = 0.0
    var float fl = 0.0
    var int   d  = 1
    fu := (ub < nz(fu[1], ub) or nz(c[1], c) > nz(fu[1], ub)) ? ub : nz(fu[1], ub)
    fl := (lb > nz(fl[1], lb) or nz(c[1], c) < nz(fl[1], lb)) ? lb : nz(fl[1], lb)
    d  := c > nz(fu[1], ub) ? 1 : c < nz(fl[1], lb) ? -1 : nz(d[1], 1)
    [d == 1 ? fl : fu, d]
[sfL, dirF] = f_ax(dH, dL, dC, 1.5, L_STF)
[ssL, dirS] = f_ax(dH, dL, dC, 3.0, L_STS)

e9  = ta.ema(dC, L_EMAF)
e21 = ta.ema(dC, L_EMAM)
e50 = ta.ema(dC, L_EMAS)
slUp = (e50 - e50[L_SLOPE]) > 0
slDn = (e50 - e50[L_SLOPE]) < 0
xUp = ta.crossover(e9, e21)
xDn = ta.crossunder(e9, e21)
sXU = ta.barssince(xUp)
sXD = ta.barssince(xDn)

bbD = 2.0 * ta.stdev(dC, L_BAND)
kcR = ta.rma(dTR, L_BAND) * 1.5
sqz = bbD < kcR
fire = not sqz and sqz[1]
ref  = math.avg(math.avg(ta.highest(dH, L_BAND), ta.lowest(dL, L_BAND)), ta.sma(dC, L_BAND))
mom  = ta.linreg(dC - ref, L_BAND, 0)
sF   = ta.barssince(fire)

phv = ta.pivothigh(dH, L_PIV, L_PIV)
plv = ta.pivotlow(dL, L_PIV, L_PIV)
var float lPH = na
var float lPL = na
if not na(phv)
    lPH := phv
if not na(plv)
    lPL := plv
var float bUp = na
var float bDn = na

vS  = ta.sma(dV, L_BAND)
wid = (dH - dL) > 1.2 * dAtr
tTh = (dH - dL) > 0 and (dC - dL) > 0.66 * (dH - dL)
bTh = (dH - dL) > 0 and (dH - dC) > 0.66 * (dH - dL)

xoTC = ta.crossover(dC, pTC)
xoR1 = ta.crossover(dC, pR1)
xoP  = ta.crossover(dC, pP)
xuBC = ta.crossunder(dC, pBC)
xuS1 = ta.crossunder(dC, pS1)
xuP  = ta.crossunder(dC, pP)
xoVW = ta.crossover(dC, refA)
xuVW = ta.crossunder(dC, refA)
xoPH = ta.crossover(dC, lPH)
xuPL = ta.crossunder(dC, lPL)

a1B = xoTC or xoR1 or (dL <= pS1 and dC > pS1 and dC > dO)
a1S = xuBC or xuS1 or (dH >= pR1 and dC < pR1 and dC < dO)
x1B = xuBC or xuP
x1S = xoTC or xoP

a2B = xoVW and dC > dO and (dC - refA) >= 0.30 * dAtr
a2S = xuVW and dC < dO and (refA - dC) >= 0.30 * dAtr
x2B = xuVW
x2S = xoVW

a3B = orUp[1] and dL <= orH and dC > orH and dC > dO
a3S = orDn[1] and dH >= orL and dC < orL and dC < dO
oM  = (nz(orH) + nz(orL)) / 2
x3B = dC < orH and dC < oM
x3S = dC > orL and dC > oM

a4B = dirF == 1 and dirS == 1 and (dirF[1] != 1 or dirS[1] != 1)
a4S = dirF == -1 and dirS == -1 and (dirF[1] != -1 or dirS[1] != -1)
x4B = dirF == -1
x4S = dirF == 1

a5B = not na(sXU) and sXU <= L_FRESH and e21 > e50 and slUp
a5S = not na(sXD) and sXD <= L_FRESH and e21 < e50 and slDn
x5B = xDn
x5S = xUp

a6B = not na(sF) and sF <= L_FRESH and mom > 0 and mom > mom[1]
a6S = not na(sF) and sF <= L_FRESH and mom < 0 and mom < mom[1]
x6B = mom < 0 or (mom < mom[1] and mom[1] < mom[2])
x6S = mom > 0 or (mom > mom[1] and mom[1] > mom[2])

a7B = not na(lPH) and xoPH
a7S = not na(lPL) and xuPL
if a7B
    bUp := lPH
if a7S
    bDn := lPL
x7B = not na(bUp) and dC < bUp
x7S = not na(bDn) and dC > bDn

a8B = dV > 2.0 * vS and wid and tTh and dC > dO
a8S = dV > 2.0 * vS and wid and bTh and dC < dO
x8B = xDn or (dV > 2.0 * vS and bTh and dC < dO)
x8S = xUp or (dV > 2.0 * vS and tTh and dC > dO)

f_pick(b, s) => isCE ? b : s
premOK = close > close[1]

inSes  = not na(time(timeframe.period, "0920-1445", "Asia/Kolkata"))
inMute = not na(time(timeframe.period, "1215-1315", "Asia/Kolkata"))
inFlat = not na(time(timeframe.period, "1510-1520", "Asia/Kolkata"))
timeOK = inSes and not inMute
corr   = ta.correlation(close, uC, L_BAND)
sgn    = isCE ? 1.0 : -1.0
syncOK = nz(corr) * sgn >= 0.30
var int dayTrade = 0
var int srNo = 0
var int trNo = 0
f_no(int n) => "#" + str.tostring(n) + " "
var int dayOpens = 0
if newDay
    dayOpens := 0
    dayTrade := 0
maxN   = maxDay == "2" ? 2 : maxDay == "3" ? 3 : maxDay == "5" ? 5 : 999999
capShared = capMode == "Shared across engines"
var int srDay = 0
var int trDay = 0
if newDay
    srDay := 0
    trDay := 0
f_cap(int used) => capShared ? dayOpens < maxN : used < maxN
capOK  = f_cap(srDay)

sigBarNew = ta.change(time(sigUseTF)) != 0
sigSame   = timeframe.in_seconds(sigUseTF) <= timeframe.in_seconds()
sigFresh  = sigSame or sigBarNew
// ── INDEX GATE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// One read of NIFTY, computed the same way on the CE chart and the PE chart, so
// at any moment at most one side is allowed to trade. Five votes on the last
// CLOSED regime candle; BULL needs +need, BEAR needs -need, anything between is
// NEUTRAL and neither chart may enter.
//   VWAP     index above / below session VWAP
//   CPR      above TC / below BC (inside the CPR votes nothing)
//   EMA      20 over 50 with price on the right side of the 20
//   ST       Supertrend 10 × 3
//   STRUCT   swing structure: HH+HL / LH+LL, flipped early by a close through
//            the trendline joining the last two swings, or through the last swing
// Then: ADX floor (no chop), room to the next index level ≥ what T1 needs, no
// chasing a candle far from the mean, a quiet first N minutes, a cooldown after
// any stop, and a daily stop limit.
gF      = "Index gate"
fltOn   = input.bool(true, "Gate entries on the index", group = gF, tooltip = "⚠ Entries are allowed only in the direction the INDEX agrees on — CE in a BULL regime, PE in a BEAR regime, nothing when it is NEUTRAL. Because both charts read the same index the same way, a CE and a PE entry can no longer fire minutes apart.\n\nTargets, stops and exits are untouched. Turn this off to get the original behaviour back.")
rgTF    = input.timeframe("5", "Regime timeframe", options = ["3", "5", "15"], group = gF)
rgNeed  = input.int(3, "Votes needed (of 5)", minval = 2, maxval = 5, group = gF)
rgHoldM = input.int(10, "Regime must hold (minutes)", minval = 0, maxval = 60, group = gF, tooltip = "A fresh flip has to survive this long before it may trade. This is what stops a CE at 09:35 and a PE at 09:45.")
adxMin  = input.int(18, "ADX floor (0 = off)", minval = 0, maxval = 40, group = gF)
roomK   = input.float(0.8, "Room to next level × T1 need (0 = off)", minval = 0.0, maxval = 2.0, step = 0.1, group = gF, tooltip = "The index distance to the next CPR / pivot / PDH-PDL / opening-range / VWAP level in the trade's direction must be at least this many times what T1 needs (the 'T1 needs' row of the strike check). A CE that needs 74 index points does not get bought 25 points under R1.")
extMax  = input.float(2.0, "Max stretch from regime EMA (ATRs, 0 = off)", minval = 0.0, maxval = 5.0, step = 0.25, group = gF, tooltip = "Blocks buying the top of a spike. Distance of the index from the regime 20 EMA, in regime ATRs.")
openSkp = input.int(15, "Skip the first minutes", minval = 0, maxval = 60, group = gF)
coolM   = input.int(20, "Cooldown after a stop (minutes)", minval = 0, maxval = 120, group = gF)
maxStp  = input.int(2, "Stop for the day after N stops (0 = off)", minval = 0, maxval = 5, group = gF)
showBlk = input.bool(true, "Mark entries the gate blocked", group = gF)

f_rg() =>
    vw = ta.vwap(hlc3)
    eF = ta.ema(close, 20)
    eS = ta.ema(close, 50)
    [stV, stD] = ta.supertrend(3.0, 10)
    [dip, dim, adx] = ta.dmi(14, 14)
    atr = ta.atr(14)
    ph = ta.pivothigh(high, 3, 3)
    pl = ta.pivotlow(low, 3, 3)
    var float h1 = na
    var float h2 = na
    var int   hx1 = na
    var int   hx2 = na
    var float l1 = na
    var float l2 = na
    var int   lx1 = na
    var int   lx2 = na
    if not na(ph)
        h2  := h1
        hx2 := hx1
        h1  := ph
        hx1 := bar_index - 3
    if not na(pl)
        l2  := l1
        lx2 := lx1
        l1  := pl
        lx1 := bar_index - 3
    // falling line through two lower highs, rising line through two higher lows
    dnOK = not na(h2) and h1 < h2 and hx1 > hx2
    upOK = not na(l2) and l1 > l2 and lx1 > lx2
    dnSl = dnOK ? (h1 - h2) / (hx1 - hx2) : 0.0
    upSl = upOK ? (l1 - l2) / (lx1 - lx2) : 0.0
    dnNow = dnOK ? h1 + dnSl * (bar_index - hx1) : na
    dnPrv = dnOK ? h1 + dnSl * (bar_index - 1 - hx1) : na
    upNow = upOK ? l1 + upSl * (bar_index - lx1) : na
    upPrv = upOK ? l1 + upSl * (bar_index - 1 - lx1) : na
    var int ms = 0
    if not na(h2) and not na(l2)
        if h1 > h2 and l1 > l2
            ms := 1
        else if h1 < h2 and l1 < l2
            ms := -1
    tlUp  = dnOK and close > dnNow and close[1] <= dnPrv
    tlDn  = upOK and close < upNow and close[1] >= upPrv
    bosUp = not na(h1) and close > h1 and close[1] <= h1
    bosDn = not na(l1) and close < l1 and close[1] >= l1
    if tlUp or bosUp
        ms := 1
    if tlDn or bosDn
        ms := -1
    vwS = close > vw ? 1 : close < vw ? -1 : 0
    emS = eF > eS and close > eF ? 1 : eF < eS and close < eF ? -1 : 0
    stS = stD < 0 ? 1 : -1
    // shifted one bar: with lookahead_on this is the last CLOSED candle, so nothing repaints
    [close[1], vwS[1], emS[1], stS[1], ms[1], adx[1], atr[1], eF[1], vw[1]]

[rgC, rgVw, rgEm, rgSt, rgMs, rgAdx, rgAtr, rgEma, rgVwap] = request.security(undSym, rgTF, f_rg(), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_on)
rgCpr  = rgC > pTC ? 1 : rgC < pBC ? -1 : 0
rgSum  = nz(rgVw) + rgCpr + nz(rgEm) + nz(rgSt) + nz(rgMs)
rgDir  = rgSum >= rgNeed ? 1 : rgSum <= -rgNeed ? -1 : 0
var int rgSince = na
if rgDir != nz(rgDir[1], 0) or na(rgSince)
    rgSince := time
rgHeld = na(rgSince) ? 0.0 : (time - rgSince) / 60000.0
want   = isCE ? 1 : -1
fBias  = rgDir == want and rgHeld >= rgHoldM
fAdx   = adxMin == 0 or nz(rgAdx) >= adxMin

// nearest index level in the trade's direction
pR2 = pP + (pdH - pdL)
pS2 = pP - (pdH - pdL)
f_near(float px, float lv, float best, bool up) =>
    float b = best
    if not na(lv)
        if up and lv > px and (na(b) or lv < b)
            b := lv
        if not up and lv < px and (na(b) or lv > b)
            b := lv
    b
f_room(float px, bool up) =>
    float b = na
    b := f_near(px, pP, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pTC, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pBC, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pR1, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pS1, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pR2, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pS2, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pdH, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, pdL, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, orDone ? orH : na, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, orDone ? orL : na, b, up)
    b := f_near(px, rgVwap, b, up)
    na(b) ? na : math.abs(b - px)
idxNeed = dlOK ? tp1p / dlEff : na
idxRoom = f_room(uC, isCE)
fRoom   = roomK == 0 or na(idxNeed) or na(idxRoom) or idxRoom >= roomK * idxNeed
stretch = nz(rgAtr) > 0 ? (uC - rgEma) / rgAtr * want : 0.0
fExt    = extMax == 0 or stretch <= extMax
fOpen   = minsIn >= openSkp

var int   fStops  = 0
var int   fLastSL = na
if newDay
    fStops  := 0
    fLastSL := na
fCool   = coolM == 0 or na(fLastSL) or (time - fLastSL) / 60000.0 >= coolM
fDayOK  = maxStp == 0 or fStops < maxStp
fltOK   = not fltOn or (fBias and fAdx and fRoom and fExt and fOpen and fCool and fDayOK)
fWhy    = not fltOn ? "off" : rgDir == 0 ? "NEUTRAL" : rgDir != want ? (rgDir == 1 ? "BULL · CE side only" : "BEAR · PE side only") : not fBias ? "flip too fresh" : not fOpen ? "opening minutes" : not fDayOK ? "stop limit hit" : not fCool ? "cooldown after stop" : not fAdx ? "ADX " + str.tostring(rgAdx, "#") + " · chop" : not fRoom ? "room " + str.tostring(idxRoom, "#") + " < " + str.tostring(roomK * idxNeed, "#") : not fExt ? "stretched " + str.tostring(stretch, "#.#") + " ATR" : "OPEN"
// after a Strike Rate stop, confluence has to break and re-form before it may re-enter
var bool srArmed = true

allow  = timeOK and syncOK and premOK and sigFresh and capOK
flatNow = inFlat

var array<bool>  stIn  = array.new<bool>(9, false)
var array<float> stEnt = array.new<float>(9, na)
var array<float> stStp = array.new<float>(9, na)
var array<bool>  st1   = array.new<bool>(9, false)
var array<float> stRem = array.new<float>(9, 0.0)
var array<float> stRe  = array.new<float>(9, 0.0)
var array<float> stMFE = array.new<float>(9, 0.0)

on  = array.from(true, scanner, true, true, scanner, scanner, scanner, true, true)
ent = array.from(f_pick(a1B,a1S), f_pick(a2B,a2S), f_pick(a3B,a3S), f_pick(a4B,a4S), f_pick(a5B,a5S), f_pick(a6B,a6S), f_pick(a7B,a7S), f_pick(a8B,a8S), false)
exi = array.from(f_pick(x1B,x1S), f_pick(x2B,x2S), f_pick(x3B,x3S), f_pick(x4B,x4S), f_pick(x5B,x5S), f_pick(x6B,x6S), f_pick(x7B,x7S), f_pick(x8B,x8S), false)

var string exWhyHold = ""
var int    exStgHold = 0
var float exPnl = na
string exWhy = ""
int    exStg = 0
bool   srBlk = false
var bool cnfPrev  = false
var bool confHeld = false
names = array.from("Anchor", "Tide", "Ignition", "Drift", "Slipstream", "Coil", "Fracture", "Surge", consN == 1 ? "Any engine" : "Confluence")

if (useSR or array.get(stIn, dIdx)) and barstate.isconfirmed
    for i = 0 to 8
        if i == 8
            ac = 0
            for j = 0 to 7
                if array.get(on, j) and array.get(stIn, j)
                    ac := ac + 1
            cnfNow = ac >= consN
            if cnfNow and not cnfPrev
                confHeld := confOK
            if not cnfNow
                confHeld := false
            cnfPrev := cnfNow
            array.set(ent, 8, cnfNow and (not useConfirm or confHeld))
            array.set(exi, 8, ac == 0)

        if array.get(stIn, i)
            e  = array.get(stEnt, i)
            sp = array.get(stStp, i)
            rm = array.get(stRem, i)
            rl = array.get(stRe, i)
            array.set(stMFE, i, math.max(array.get(stMFE, i), high - e))
            bool  out = false
            float opx = na

            if low <= sp
                out := true
                opx := sp
                if i == dIdx
                    exWhy := "SL"
                    exStg := 0
            else
                if not array.get(st1, i) and high >= e + tp1p
                    array.set(st1, i, true)
                    rl  := rl + rm * tp1p
                    rm  := 0.0
                    out := true
                    opx := e + tp1p
                    if i == dIdx
                        exWhy := "T1"
                        exStg := 1
                if not out and (array.get(exi, i) or flatNow)
                    out := true
                    opx := close
                    if i == dIdx
                        exWhy := flatNow ? "EOD" : "EXIT"
                        exStg := 0

            if out
                if rm > 0
                    rl := rl + rm * (opx - e)
                if i == dIdx
                    exPnl := rl
                m = array.get(stMFE, i)
                array.set(stIn, i, false)
                array.set(stEnt, i, na)
                array.set(stStp, i, na)
                array.set(st1, i, false)
                array.set(stRem, i, 0.0)
                array.set(stRe, i, 0.0)
                array.set(stMFE, i, 0.0)
            else
                array.set(stStp, i, sp)
                array.set(stRem, i, rm)
                array.set(stRe, i, rl)
        else
            bool gateOK = i != dIdx or (fltOK and srArmed)
            if i == dIdx and useSR and array.get(ent, i) and allow and not flatNow and not gateOK
                srBlk := true
            if useSR and array.get(on, i) and array.get(ent, i) and allow and not flatNow and close > 0 and gateOK
                array.set(stIn, i, true)
                array.set(stEnt, i, close)
                array.set(stStp, i, math.max(close - slp, syminfo.mintick))
                array.set(st1, i, false)
                array.set(stRem, i, 1.0)
                array.set(stRe, i, 0.0)
                array.set(stMFE, i, 0.0)

if exWhy == "SL"
    srArmed := false
else if not cnfPrev
    srArmed := true

dIn   = array.get(stIn, dIdx)
dEnt  = array.get(stEnt, dIdx)
dStp  = array.get(stStp, dIdx)
dEntPrev = nz(dEnt[1], dEnt)
dStpPrev = nz(dStp[1], dStp)
if exWhy != ""
    exWhyHold := exWhy
    exStgHold := exStg
srIn  = dIn
justIn  = srIn and not srIn[1]
if justIn and barstate.isconfirmed
    dayOpens := dayOpens + 1
    srDay := srDay + 1
    dayTrade := dayTrade + 1
    srNo := dayTrade
justOut = not srIn and srIn[1]

int   trLen  = trSpeed == "Scalp" ? (tf1 ? 100 : tf3 ? 33 : 20) : trSpeed == "Swing" ? (tf1 ? 275 : tf3 ? 92 : 55) : (tf1 ? 170 : tf3 ? 57 : 34)
float trMult = trSpeed == "Scalp" ? 1.2 : trSpeed == "Swing" ? 2.2 : 1.6

f_bx(int len, float mult, float stx, int hold, bool chop, float chopN, int erLen, int atrLen) =>
    b  = ta.vwma(close, len)
    bd = ta.atr(len) * mult
    up = b + bd
    dn = b - bd
    var int d = 0
    if close > up
        d := 1
    else if close < dn
        d := -1
    fu   = d ==  1 and nz(d[1], 0) !=  1
    fd   = d == -1 and nz(d[1], 0) != -1
    held = nz(ta.barssince(fu or fd), 9999)
    [stLine, stDir] = ta.supertrend(stx, atrLen)
    net  = math.abs(close - nz(close[erLen], close))
    path = math.sum(math.abs(close - nz(close[1], close)), erLen)
    er   = path > 0 ? net / path : 0.0
    ok   = not chop or er >= chopN
    cu   = d ==  1 and held == hold and stDir < 0 and ok
    cd   = d == -1 and held == hold and stDir > 0 and ok
    [b, up, dn, d, cu, cd, er]

var bool  trPos  = false
var float trEnt  = na
var float trStop = na
var int   trStg  = 0
trUseTF = trTF == "" ? timeframe.period : trTF
[bsA, bsU, bsD, trDir, trRawU, trRawD, trER] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, trUseTF, f_bx(trLen, trMult, trStX, trHold, trChop, trChopN, L_BAND, L_ATR), barmerge.gaps_off, barmerge.lookahead_off)

var int trLastSig = na
trGapOK = na(trLastSig) or (bar_index - trLastSig) >= trGap

trAllow = timeOK and syncOK and premOK and sigFresh and f_cap(trDay)
trBlk   = useTR and not trPos and trRawU and trGapOK and trAllow and not flatNow and barstate.isconfirmed and not fltOK
trSigU  = useTR and not trPos and trRawU and trGapOK and trAllow and fltOK and not flatNow and barstate.isconfirmed
trSigD  = trRawD and barstate.isconfirmed
if trSigU or trSigD
    trLastSig := bar_index

var int   trWin  = 0
var int   trLoss = 0
var float trNet2 = 0.0
bool trOpen = false
bool trStopHit = false
bool trExit = false
float trOut = na

if (useTR or trPos) and barstate.isconfirmed
    if not trPos
        if trSigU
            trPos  := true
            trEnt  := close
            trStop := math.max(close - slp, syminfo.mintick)
            trStg  := 0
            trOpen := true
            dayOpens := dayOpens + 1
            trDay := trDay + 1
            dayTrade := dayTrade + 1
            trNo   := dayTrade
    else
        if low <= trStop
            trStopHit := true
            trExit := true
            trPos  := false
            trOut  := trStop
            trLoss := trLoss + 1
            trNet2 := trNet2 + (trStop - trEnt)
        else
            if trStg < 1 and high >= trEnt + tp1p
                trStg := 1
                trExit := true
                trPos  := false
                trOut  := trEnt + tp1p
                trWin  := trWin + 1
                trNet2 := trNet2 + tp1p
            if trPos and trSigD
                trExit := true
                trPos  := false
                trOut  := close
                trNet2 := trNet2 + (close - trEnt)
                if close > trEnt
                    trWin := trWin + 1
                else
                    trLoss := trLoss + 1
            if trPos and flatNow
                trExit := true
                trPos  := false
                trOut  := close
                trNet2 := trNet2 + (close - trEnt)
                if close > trEnt
                    trWin := trWin + 1
                else
                    trLoss := trLoss + 1

if barstate.isconfirmed and (exWhy == "SL" or trStopHit)
    fStops  := fStops + 1
    fLastSL := time

bsC = trDir == 1 ? colUp : trDir == -1 ? colDn : colFl

agree = (srIn ? 1 : 0) + (trPos ? 1 : 0)
dots = (agree >= 1 ? "●" : "○") + (agree >= 2 ? "●" : "○")

plot(useTR and ribGlow ? bsA : na, "Ribbon bloom", color.new(bsC, 80), 11, display = display.pane)
plot(useTR and ribGlow ? bsA : na, "Ribbon inner", color.new(bsC, 42), 5,  display = display.pane)
pB  = plot(useTR and trRib ? bsA : na, "Ribbon", bsC, 2, display = display.pane)
pU  = plot(useTR and ribFill ? bsU : na, "Upper", color.new(bsC, ribGlow ? 88 : 94), 1, display = display.pane)
pD  = plot(useTR and ribFill ? bsD : na, "Lower", color.new(bsC, ribGlow ? 88 : 94), 1, display = display.pane)
bsP = nz(bsU - bsA) > 0 ? math.min(math.abs(close - bsA) / (bsU - bsA), 1.0) : 0.0
ribBase  = ribGlow ? 88 : 96
ribSwing = ribGlow ? 33.0 : 6.0
bsT = int(ribBase - ribSwing * bsP)
fill(pU, pB, useTR and ribFill ? color.new(bsC, bsT) : na, "Upper fill")
fill(pD, pB, useTR and ribFill ? color.new(bsC, bsT) : na, "Lower fill")

var int rawA = 0
var int takA = 0
var int rawB = 0
var int takB = 0
if barstate.isconfirmed
    if array.get(ent, 8)
        rawA := rawA + 1
    if justIn
        takA := takA + 1
    if trRawU
        rawB := rawB + 1
    if trOpen
        takB := takB + 1

var int   dayN   = 0
var int   dayT1  = 0
var int   daySL  = 0
var float dayPts = 0.0
if newDay
    dayN     := 0
    dayT1    := 0
    daySL    := 0
    dayPts   := 0.0

sbOpen = justIn or trOpen
srClosed = justOut
srPnl    = nz(exPnl, 0.0)

trPnl = trExit ? nz(trOut, close) - trEnt : 0.0
otherPnl = trPnl
tradePnl = (srClosed ? srPnl : 0.0) + otherPnl
if barstate.isconfirmed
    if justIn
        dayN := dayN + 1
    if trOpen
        dayN := dayN + 1
    if srClosed
        dayPts := dayPts + srPnl
        if exStgHold >= 1
            dayT1 := dayT1 + 1
        else if exWhyHold == "SL"
            daySL := daySL + 1
    if trExit
        dayPts := dayPts + trPnl
        if trStg >= 1
            dayT1 := dayT1 + 1
        else if trStopHit
            daySL := daySL + 1

anyPos = srIn or trPos
priEnt = srIn ? dEnt : trEnt
priStp = srIn ? dStp : trStop
priT1  = na(priEnt) ? na : priEnt + tp1p
bxTop  = exitAll ? tp1p : tp3p
priT2  = na(priEnt) ? na : priEnt + bxTop

var int  posBar   = na
var bool staleFired = false
if anyPos and not anyPos[1]
    posBar := bar_index
    staleFired := false
if not anyPos
    posBar := na
    staleFired := false
preT1  = anyPos and not na(priEnt) and not na(priStp) and priStp < priEnt
staleAge = anyPos and not na(posBar) ? bar_index - posBar : 0
staleNow = useStale and anyPos and preT1 and staleAge >= staleN and not staleFired and barstate.isconfirmed
if staleNow
    staleFired := true

var array<line>  lnE  = array.new<line>(2, na)
var array<line>  lnT1 = array.new<line>(2, na)
var array<line>  lnS  = array.new<line>(2, na)
var array<label> tgT1 = array.new<label>(2, na)
var array<label> tgS  = array.new<label>(2, na)
var array<bool>  wasIn = array.new<bool>(2, false)

engCol  = array.from(cSR, cTR)
engSty  = array.from(line.style_solid, line.style_dashed)
engWid  = array.from(2, 2)
engTag  = array.from("SR", "TR")
engIn   = array.from(srIn, trPos)
engEnt  = array.from(dEnt, trEnt)
engStp  = array.from(dStp, trStop)

for e = 0 to 1
    held = array.get(engIn, e)
    ent  = array.get(engEnt, e)
    stp  = array.get(engStp, e)
    col  = array.get(engCol, e)
    sty  = array.get(engSty, e)
    wid  = array.get(engWid, e)
    if held and not na(ent)
        if not array.get(wasIn, e)
            line.delete(array.get(lnE,  e))
            line.delete(array.get(lnT1, e))
            line.delete(array.get(lnS,  e))
            label.delete(array.get(tgT1, e))
            label.delete(array.get(tgS,  e))
            array.set(lnE,  e, line.new(bar_index, ent, bar_index + 1, ent, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(col, 45), width = 1, style = sty))
            array.set(lnT1, e, line.new(bar_index, ent + tp1p, bar_index + 1, ent + tp1p, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = col, width = wid, style = sty))
            array.set(lnS,  e, line.new(bar_index, stp, bar_index + 1, stp, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = cSTOP, width = wid, style = sty))
            array.set(tgT1, e, label.new(bar_index + 1, ent + tp1p, "T1·" + array.get(engTag, e), xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(col, 80), textcolor = col, size = size.tiny))
            array.set(tgS,  e, label.new(bar_index + 1, stp, "SL·" + array.get(engTag, e), xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(cSTOP, 80), textcolor = cSTOP, size = size.tiny))
        else
            line.set_x2(array.get(lnE,  e), bar_index + 1)
            line.set_x2(array.get(lnT1, e), bar_index + 1)
            line.set_x2(array.get(lnS,  e), bar_index + 1)
            line.set_y1(array.get(lnS,  e), stp)
            line.set_y2(array.get(lnS,  e), stp)
            label.set_x(array.get(tgT1, e), bar_index + 1)
            label.set_x(array.get(tgS,  e), bar_index + 1)
            label.set_y(array.get(tgS,  e), stp)
    else
        if array.get(wasIn, e)
            line.delete(array.get(lnE,  e))
            line.delete(array.get(lnT1, e))
            line.delete(array.get(lnS,  e))
            label.delete(array.get(tgT1, e))
            label.delete(array.get(tgS,  e))
            array.set(lnE,  e, na)
            array.set(lnT1, e, na)
            array.set(lnS,  e, na)
            array.set(tgT1, e, na)
            array.set(tgS,  e, na)
    array.set(wasIn, e, held and not na(ent))

plotshape(justIn ? low : na, "Entry · Strike Rate", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, cSR, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(trOpen ? low : na, "Entry · SR Trend",    shape.diamond,    location.belowbar, cTR, size = size.tiny)

plotshape(justOut ? high : na, "Exit · Strike Rate", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, cSR, size = size.tiny)
plotshape((trExit and not trOpen) ? high : na, "Exit · SR Trend", shape.diamond, location.abovebar, cTR, size = size.tiny)

barcolor(paint and anyPos ? color.new(colUp, 55) : na, title = "In a trade")
bgcolor(tint and anyPos ? color.new(colUp, 94) : na, title = "In-trade tint")

var array<line> dayLn = array.new<line>()
if showDay and newDay
    dayLn.push(line.new(bar_index, close, bar_index, close + syminfo.mintick, xloc = xloc.bar_index, extend = extend.both, color = color.new(colNu, 78), style = line.style_dotted, width = 1))
    while dayLn.size() > 20
        line.delete(dayLn.shift())

var box   bxRew = na
var box   bxRsk = na
var label bxLbR = na
var label bxLbK = na
newPos = anyPos and not anyPos[1]

closedNow = not anyPos and anyPos[1]
if showBox and closedNow and not na(bxRew)
    box.set_bgcolor(bxRew, color.new(colUp, 97))
    box.set_border_color(bxRew, color.new(colUp, 70))
    box.set_bgcolor(bxRsk, color.new(colDn, 97))
    box.set_border_color(bxRsk, color.new(colDn, 70))
    label.set_color(bxLbR, color.new(colUp, 60))
    label.set_color(bxLbK, color.new(colDn, 60))
    label.set_textcolor(bxLbR, color.new(color.black, 45))
    label.set_textcolor(bxLbK, color.new(color.white, 45))

if showBox and newPos and not na(priEnt)
    box.delete(bxRew)
    box.delete(bxRsk)
    label.delete(bxLbR)
    label.delete(bxLbK)
    bxRew := box.new(bar_index, priT2, bar_index + 1, priEnt, border_color = color.new(colUp, 30), border_width = 1, bgcolor = color.new(colUp, 93))
    bxRsk := box.new(bar_index, priEnt, bar_index + 1, priStp, border_color = color.new(colDn, 30), border_width = 1, bgcolor = color.new(colDn, 93))
    bxLbR := label.new(bar_index + 1, priT2, "+₹" + str.tostring(bxTop * lotSz, "#,###"), xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_left, color = colUp, textcolor = f_ink(colUp), size = size.tiny)
    bxLbK := label.new(bar_index + 1, priStp, "−₹" + str.tostring((priEnt - priStp) * lotSz, "#,###"), xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_left, color = colDn, textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)

if showBox and anyPos and not na(bxRew)
    box.set_right(bxRew, bar_index + 1)
    box.set_right(bxRsk, bar_index + 1)
    label.set_x(bxLbR, bar_index + 1)
    label.set_x(bxLbK, bar_index + 1)

f_gl(string k) =>
    mStyle == "Text" ? (k == "up" ? "BUY" : k == "t1" ? "T1" : k == "r2" ? "RAN T2" : k == "r3" ? "RAN T3" : k == "sl" ? "SL" : k == "eod" ? "EOD" : k == "tag" ? "TAG" : "EXIT") : (k == "up" ? "▲" : k == "t1" ? "✓ T1" : k == "r2" ? "↗ T2" : k == "r3" ? "↗ T3" : k == "sl" ? "✕ SL" : k == "eod" ? "▼ EOD" : k == "tag" ? "◆ TAG" : "▼ EXIT")

showTxt = showLbl and mStyle != "Minimal"

lane = ta.atr(14)
f_lane(int e) => nz(lane, close * 0.02) * (0.6 + 0.75 * e)

f_tag(string t, float px, color c, int e) =>
    label.new(bar_index, low - f_lane(e), t + "  " + str.tostring(px, format.mintick), yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_up, color = c, textcolor = f_ink(c), size = size.small)
f_out(string t, float px, color c, bool dark, int e) =>
    label.new(bar_index, high + f_lane(e), t + "  " + str.tostring(px, format.mintick), yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_down, color = c, textcolor = f_ink(c), size = size.small)

if showTxt and justIn
    f_tag(f_no(srNo) + f_gl("up") + " SR " + dots, dEnt, cSR, 0)
if showTxt and trOpen
    f_tag(f_no(trNo) + f_gl("up") + " TR " + dots, trEnt, cTR, 1)

srPxA = exWhyHold == "SL" ? dStpPrev : exWhyHold == "T1" ? dEntPrev + tp1p : close
f_exWord(bool stopped, int stg, bool eod) =>
    stopped ? f_gl("sl") : stg >= 1 ? f_gl("t1") : eod ? f_gl("eod") : f_gl("out")
f_exCol(bool stopped, int stg) =>
    stopped ? colDn : stg >= 1 ? colT1 : colNu
f_exit(string eng, int no, bool stopped, int stg, bool eod, float px, int lane) =>
    f_out(f_no(no) + f_exWord(stopped, stg, eod) + " · " + eng, px, f_exCol(stopped, stg), stopped, lane)

if showTxt and justOut
    srPx = srPxA
    f_exit("SR", srNo, exWhyHold == "SL", exStgHold, exWhyHold == "EOD", srPx, 0)
if showTxt and trExit
    f_exit("TR", trNo, trStopHit, trStg, flatNow, nz(trOut, close), 1)

var array<line>  tmLn = array.new<line>()
var array<label> tmLb = array.new<label>()
f_tmark(float px, string tag, string kind, color col, int no, bool ghost = false) =>
    tmLb.push(label.new(bar_index, px, f_no(no) + f_gl(kind) + " · " + tag + "  " + str.tostring(px, format.mintick), yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_left, color = ghost ? color.new(col, 82) : col, textcolor = ghost ? col : f_ink(col), size = size.small))
    tmLn.push(line.new(bar_index - 1, px, bar_index + 3, px, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = ghost ? color.new(col, 45) : col, width = ghost ? 1 : 2, style = ghost ? line.style_dashed : line.style_solid))
    while tmLn.size() > 120
        line.delete(tmLn.shift())
    while tmLb.size() > 120
        label.delete(tmLb.shift())

var float rchEnt = na
var int    rchNo  = 0
var string rchTag = ""
var bool   rch2   = false
var bool   rch3   = false
if justOut and (exWhyHold == "T1")
    rchEnt := dEntPrev
    rchNo  := srNo
    rchTag := "SR"
    rch2   := false
    rch3   := false
if trExit and (trStg >= 1)
    rchEnt := trEnt
    rchNo  := trNo
    rchTag := "TR"
    rch2   := false
    rch3   := false
if sbOpen or flatNow or newDay
    rchEnt := na
    rch2   := false
    rch3   := false
rchLive = rchOn and showTxt and not na(rchEnt) and not anyPos and barstate.isconfirmed
if rchLive and not rch2 and high >= rchEnt + tp2p
    rch2 := true
    f_tmark(rchEnt + tp2p, rchTag, "r2", colT2, rchNo, true)
if rchLive and not rch3 and high >= rchEnt + tp3p
    rch3 := true
    f_tmark(rchEnt + tp3p, rchTag, "r3", colT3, rchNo, true)

var bool srTag = false
var bool trTag = false
if justIn
    srTag := false
if trOpen
    trTag := false

f_tenpt(bool live, float ent, string tag, int no, bool already) =>
    bool fired = false
    if tagOn and live and not already and not na(ent) and barstate.isconfirmed and high >= ent + tagPts
        fired := true
        if showTxt
            label.new(bar_index, ent + tagPts, f_no(no) + f_gl("tag") + " · " + tag + "  +" + str.tostring(tagPts, "#"), yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(colTag, 25), textcolor = f_ink(color.new(colTag, 0)), size = size.tiny)
    fired

srTagNow = f_tenpt(srIn,  dEnt,  "SR", srNo, srTag)
trTagNow = f_tenpt(trPos, trEnt, "TR", trNo, trTag)
if srTagNow
    srTag := true
if trTagNow
    trTag := true
tagNow = srTagNow or trTagNow
tagPx  = srTagNow ? dEnt + tagPts : trTagNow ? trEnt + tagPts : na
plotshape(tagNow and not showTxt ? tagPx : na, "First move in your favour", shape.diamond, location.absolute, color.new(colTag, 20), size = size.tiny)

plotshape(staleNow, "Stale", shape.diamond, location.belowbar, color.new(colDn, 45), size = size.tiny)
blkRaw = showBlk and fltOn and (srBlk or trBlk) and not anyPos
blkNow = blkRaw and not blkRaw[1]
plotshape(blkNow, "Blocked by index gate", shape.xcross, location.belowbar, color.new(colFl, 30), size = size.tiny)
if blkNow and showTxt
    label.new(bar_index, low, "⊘ " + fWhy, yloc = yloc.belowbar, style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(colFl, 70), textcolor = color.new(color.white, 20), size = size.tiny)
if showTxt and staleNow
    label.new(bar_index, low, mStyle == "Text" ? "STALE " + str.tostring(staleAge) + "b" : "◇ " + str.tostring(staleAge) + "b", yloc = yloc.belowbar, style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(colDn, 45), textcolor = f_ink(colDn), size = size.tiny)

var table sk = table.new(position.bottom_right, 2, 9, border_width = 1, frame_width = 1, frame_color = color.new(color.gray, 45))
if showStk and barstate.islast
    szK    = size.small
    bgLumK = 0.299 * color.r(chart.bg_color) + 0.587 * color.g(chart.bg_color) + 0.114 * color.b(chart.bg_color)
    liteK  = bgLumK > 128
    kb     = liteK ? color.new(#e8eaed, 0) : color.new(#101826, 0)
    kt     = liteK ? color.new(#3c4043, 0) : color.new(color.white, 30)

    t1Pct  = close > 0 ? 100.0 * tp1p / close : na
    slPct  = close > 0 ? 100.0 * slp  / close : na
    needPt = dlOK ? tp1p / dlEff : na

    isIdx  = dlOK and dlEff > 0.9
    grade  = isIdx          ? "INDEX CHART"    :
             na(t1Pct)      ? "—"              :
             t1Pct <= 20.0  ? "GOOD"           :
             t1Pct <= 30.0  ? "TIGHT"          : "TOO FAR OUT"
    gCol   = isIdx ? color.new(color.gray, 25) :
             grade == "GOOD" ? color.new(colUp, 25) :
             grade == "TIGHT" ? color.new(#f5a524, 25) : color.new(colDn, 25)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 0, "STRIKE CHECK", bgcolor = kb, text_color = liteK ? color.black : color.white, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 0, okType ? (isCE ? "CALL" : "PUT") : "CANNOT READ — ASSUMING CALL", bgcolor = okType ? kb : color.new(colDn, 20), text_color = kt, text_size = szK)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 1, "Premium", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 1, str.tostring(close, "#.##"), bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 2, "Delta (measured)", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 2, dlOK ? str.tostring(dlEff, "#.00") : "warming up", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 3, "T1 needs", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 3, na(needPt) ? "—" : str.tostring(needPt, "#") + " index pts", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 4, "T1 / stop of premium", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 4, na(t1Pct) ? "—" : str.tostring(t1Pct, "#") + "%  /  " + str.tostring(slPct, "#") + "%", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 5, "Verdict", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 5, grade, bgcolor = gCol, text_color = color.white, text_size = szK)

    table.cell(sk, 0, 6, "Chart timeframe", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 6, tfSay,
         bgcolor = tfOK ? kb : color.new(colDn, 20), text_color = tfOK ? kt : color.white, text_size = szK)

    rgTxt = (rgDir == 1 ? "BULL " : rgDir == -1 ? "BEAR " : "NEUTRAL ") + (rgSum >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(rgSum) + "/5"
    rgCol = rgDir == 1 ? color.new(colUp, 25) : rgDir == -1 ? color.new(colDn, 25) : color.new(color.gray, 25)
    table.cell(sk, 0, 7, "Index regime", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 7, fltOn ? rgTxt : "gate off", bgcolor = fltOn ? rgCol : kb, text_color = color.white, text_size = szK)
    table.cell(sk, 0, 8, "Gate", bgcolor = kb, text_color = kt, text_size = szK, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(sk, 1, 8, fWhy, bgcolor = fltOK and fltOn ? color.new(colUp, 25) : kb, text_color = fltOK and fltOn ? color.white : kt, text_size = szK)

gL  = "Levels"
gL2 = "Levels · S/R"
gL3 = "Levels · Trendlines"

mSR = input.bool(false, "S/R levels", group = gL, inline = "lv", tooltip = "⚠ Prices this CONTRACT keeps reacting to, from up to five timeframes at once. Off by default.\n\nThese are the premium's own levels, not Nifty's. Measured on the bhavcopy: with the index standing still the premium still falls a median of 12.8 points a day, so the same Nifty level prints at a different premium every day and the touches never stack up the way they do on an index chart. Useful for reading where THIS contract has traded; not a map of Nifty support and resistance.")
mTL = input.bool(false, "Trendlines & triangles", group = gL, inline = "lv", tooltip = "⚠ Rising and falling trendlines, their channel, and converging shapes. Off by default.\n\nDrawn on the premium, so the slope is not a fixed translation of a Nifty slope - fitted delta runs from 0.64 deep in the money to 0.14 far out, and a trade travels across that range in an hour. Decay also pulls both lines down together, which can manufacture a triangle where Nifty is not coiling at all.")

rl5On   = input.bool(true,  "5m",  group = gL2, inline = "ra")
rl5C    = input.color(#42A5F5, "", group = gL2, inline = "ra")
rl15On  = input.bool(true,  "15m", group = gL2, inline = "ra")
rl15C   = input.color(#AB47BC, "", group = gL2, inline = "ra")
rl30On  = input.bool(false, "30m", group = gL2, inline = "ra")
rl30C   = input.color(#FFA726, "", group = gL2, inline = "ra")
rl60On  = input.bool(true,  "1H",  group = gL2, inline = "rb")
rl60C   = input.color(#66BB6A, "", group = gL2, inline = "rb")
rl240On = input.bool(false, "4H",  group = gL2, inline = "rb")
rl240C  = input.color(#EC407A, "", group = gL2, inline = "rb")
rlDOn   = input.bool(false, "1D",  group = gL2, inline = "rb")
rlDC    = input.color(#EEEEEE, "", group = gL2, inline = "rb")
rlMax   = input.int(3, "Timeframes running at once", minval = 2, maxval = 5, group = gL2)
rlPer   = input.int(2, "Levels per timeframe (each side)", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = gL2)
rlSens  = input.string("Normal", "Sensitivity", options = ["Strict", "Normal", "Loose"], group = gL2)
rlFlipOnly = input.bool(false, "Flip levels only", group = gL2)

tlMode = input.string("Fixed (from history)", "Mode", options = ["Fixed (from history)", "Live (updates each candle)"], group = gL3)
tlStyle = input.string("Triangles only", "Draw", options = ["Triangles only", "Triangles + channel", "Channel", "Trendlines only"], group = gL3, inline = "ts")
tlFill  = input.bool(true, "shade", group = gL3, inline = "ts")
tlUpC   = input.color(#26A69A, "Rising",  group = gL3, inline = "tc")
tlDnC   = input.color(#EF5350, "Falling", group = gL3, inline = "tc")
tlPiv   = input.int(5, "Swing strength", minval = 2, maxval = 20, group = gL3, inline = "tp")
tlMinT  = input.int(2, "min touches", minval = 2, maxval = 5, group = gL3, inline = "tp")
tlConvS = input.string("Normal", "Triangle reach", options = ["Strict", "Normal", "Loose"], group = gL3)
tlExt   = input.int(30, "Extend right (candles)", minval = 0, maxval = 200, group = gL3)
tlReg   = input.bool(true, "Regression channel when no trendline qualifies", group = gL3)
lvLbls  = input.bool(true, "Level labels", group = gL)

sym      = syminfo.tickerid
atr14    = ta.atr(14)
wRoll    = ta.change(time("W")) != 0
intra    = timeframe.isintraday
showLbls = lvLbls
FAR_PCT  = 3.0
LBL_OFF  = 3
MAXBACK  = 1900
fD       = 1.0
near(float v, float mult) =>
    not na(v) and close != 0 and math.abs(v - close) / close * 100.0 <= FAR_PCT * mult

var int dStart = 0
var int wStart = 0
if newDay
    dStart := bar_index
if wRoll
    wStart := bar_index

type Lvl
    float px
    float sum
    int   hits
    int   hiHits
    int   loHits
    int   crosses
    int   lastSide
    int   firstB
    int   lastN

type Eng
    string tf
    string name
    color  col
    bool   on
    int    tfSec
    int    lb
    float  halfBars
    int    cutMs
    array<Lvl> pool
    int    lastT = na
    int    n     = 0
    float  prevC = na
    float  atr   = na

RL_LEFT  = 3
RL_RIGHT = 3
RL_POOL  = 40
RL_BONUS = 2.0
RL_SESS  = 22500.0
rlSep    = RL_LEFT + RL_RIGHT
rlMinT   = rlSens == "Strict" ? 4    : rlSens == "Loose" ? 2   : 3
rlMerge  = rlSens == "Strict" ? 0.45 : rlSens == "Loose" ? 0.8 : 0.6
rlSide   = rlSens == "Loose"  ? 1    : 2
rlCross  = rlSens == "Strict" ? 2    : 1
cSec     = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.period)

rlBars(int sec) =>
    sec <= 300 ? 375 : sec <= 900 ? 250 : sec <= 1800 ? 250 : sec <= 3600 ? 250 : sec <= 14400 ? 170 : 500

newEng(string tf, string nm, color c, bool on) =>
    int   sec = timeframe.in_seconds(tf)
    int   lb  = rlBars(sec)
    float bps = sec >= 86400 ? 1.0 : RL_SESS / math.max(sec, 1)
    float cal = sec < 86400 ? lb * sec / RL_SESS : lb * 1.0
    Eng.new(tf, nm, c, on, sec, lb, math.max(5.0 * bps, lb * 0.35), int(cal * 1.6 * 86400000), array.new<Lvl>())

rlFits(string tf) => timeframe.in_seconds(tf) >= cSec
q1 = mSR and rl5On   and rlFits("5")
n1 = (q1 ? 1 : 0)
q2 = mSR and rl15On  and rlFits("15")  and n1 < rlMax
n2 = n1 + (q2 ? 1 : 0)
q3 = mSR and rl30On  and rlFits("30")  and n2 < rlMax
n3 = n2 + (q3 ? 1 : 0)
q4 = mSR and rl60On  and rlFits("60")  and n3 < rlMax
n4 = n3 + (q4 ? 1 : 0)
q5 = mSR and rl240On and rlFits("240") and n4 < rlMax
n5 = n4 + (q5 ? 1 : 0)
q6 = mSR and rlDOn   and rlFits("D")   and n5 < rlMax
rlTicked  = (rl5On ? 1 : 0) + (rl15On ? 1 : 0) + (rl30On ? 1 : 0) + (rl60On ? 1 : 0) + (rl240On ? 1 : 0) + (rlDOn ? 1 : 0)
rlRunning = n5 + (q6 ? 1 : 0)

var array<Eng> engs = array.new<Eng>()
if barstate.isfirst
    engs.push(newEng("5",   "5m",  rl5C,   q1))
    engs.push(newEng("15",  "15m", rl15C,  q2))
    engs.push(newEng("30",  "30m", rl30C,  q3))
    engs.push(newEng("60",  "1H",  rl60C,  q4))
    engs.push(newEng("240", "4H",  rl240C, q5))
    engs.push(newEng("D",   "1D",  rlDC,   q6))

f_rlSrc() =>
    pH = ta.pivothigh(high, RL_LEFT, RL_RIGHT)
    pL = ta.pivotlow(low, RL_LEFT, RL_RIGHT)
    [pH[1], pL[1], time[1], high[1], low[1], close[1]]

f_rlReq(string tf, bool on) =>
    [h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6] = request.security(sym, on ? tf : timeframe.period, f_rlSrc(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
    [h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6]

rlIsFlip(Lvl L0) =>
    L0.hiHits >= rlSide and L0.loHits >= rlSide and L0.crosses >= rlCross

rlScore(Lvl L0, Eng e) =>
    float age = math.max(e.n - L0.lastN, 0)
    (L0.hits + (rlIsFlip(L0) ? RL_BONUS : 0.0)) * math.pow(0.5, age / e.halfBars)

rlCap(Eng e) =>
    array<Lvl> pool = e.pool
    while pool.size() > RL_POOL
        int   worst = 0
        float ws    = rlScore(pool.get(0), e)
        for k = 1 to pool.size() - 1
            float sc = rlScore(pool.get(k), e)
            if sc < ws
                ws    := sc
                worst := k
        pool.remove(worst)
    pool.size()

rlPrune(Eng e) =>
    array<Lvl> pool = e.pool
    int k = pool.size() - 1
    while k >= 0
        if pool.get(k).lastN < e.n - e.lb
            pool.remove(k)
        k -= 1
    pool.size()

rlFind(array<Lvl> pool, float px, float md) =>
    int   best  = -1
    float bestD = md
    int   cnt   = pool.size()
    if cnt > 0
        for i = 0 to cnt - 1
            float d = math.abs(pool.get(i).px - px)
            if d <= bestD
                bestD := d
                best  := i
    best

rlAbsorb(array<Lvl> pool, int i, float md) =>
    Lvl L0 = pool.get(i)
    int j = -1
    for k = 0 to pool.size() - 1
        if k != i and math.abs(pool.get(k).px - L0.px) <= md
            j := k
            break
    if j >= 0
        Lvl L1 = pool.get(j)
        L0.sum     := L0.sum + L1.sum
        L0.hits    := L0.hits + L1.hits
        L0.px      := L0.sum / L0.hits
        L0.hiHits  := L0.hiHits + L1.hiHits
        L0.loHits  := L0.loHits + L1.loHits
        L0.crosses := L0.crosses + L1.crosses
        L0.firstB  := math.min(L0.firstB, L1.firstB)
        L0.lastN   := math.max(L0.lastN, L1.lastN)
        pool.remove(j)
    j

rlAdd(Eng e, float px, int side, int cn, int fb, float md) =>
    array<Lvl> pool = e.pool
    int i = rlFind(pool, px, md)
    if i == -1
        pool.push(Lvl.new(px, px, 1, side == 1 ? 1 : 0, side == -1 ? 1 : 0, 0, side == 1 ? -1 : 1, fb, cn))
    else
        Lvl L0 = pool.get(i)
        if math.abs(cn - L0.lastN) >= rlSep
            L0.sum   := L0.sum + px
            L0.hits  := L0.hits + 1
            L0.px    := L0.sum / L0.hits
            L0.lastN := math.max(L0.lastN, cn)
            if side == 1
                L0.hiHits := L0.hiHits + 1
            else
                L0.loHits := L0.loHits + 1
        L0.firstB := math.min(L0.firstB, fb)
        rlAbsorb(pool, i, md)
    rlCap(e)

rlScan(array<Lvl> pool, float h, float l, float c, float pc, int cn, float half) =>
    int cnt = pool.size()
    if cnt > 0
        for i = 0 to cnt - 1
            Lvl L0 = pool.get(i)
            float p = L0.px
            bool resRej = pc < p - half and h >= p - half and c < p - half
            bool supRej = pc > p + half and l <= p + half and c > p + half
            if (resRej or supRej) and cn - L0.lastN >= rlSep
                L0.sum   := L0.sum + p
                L0.hits  := L0.hits + 1
                L0.lastN := cn
                if resRej
                    L0.hiHits := L0.hiHits + 1
                else
                    L0.loHits := L0.loHits + 1
            int sd = c > p + half ? 1 : c < p - half ? -1 : 0
            if sd != 0
                if L0.lastSide != 0 and sd != L0.lastSide
                    L0.crosses := L0.crosses + 1
                L0.lastSide := sd
    cnt

rlStep(Eng e, float pH, float pL, int t, float h, float l, float c) =>
    bool done = false
    if not na(t) and (na(e.lastT) or t > e.lastT) and t >= last_bar_time - e.cutMs
        e.lastT := t
        e.n     := e.n + 1
        float tr = na(e.prevC) ? h - l : math.max(h - l, math.abs(h - e.prevC), math.abs(l - e.prevC))
        e.atr := na(e.atr) ? tr : (e.atr * 13.0 + tr) / 14.0
        if e.n > 14 and e.atr > 0
            float md = e.atr * rlMerge
            if not na(e.prevC)
                rlScan(e.pool, h, l, c, e.prevC, e.n, md * 0.5)
            int pb = math.max(bar_index - int(math.ceil((RL_RIGHT + 1) * e.tfSec / math.max(cSec, 1.0))), 0)
            if not na(pH)
                rlAdd(e, pH, 1, e.n - RL_RIGHT, pb, md)
            if not na(pL)
                rlAdd(e, pL, -1, e.n - RL_RIGHT, pb, md)
            if e.n % 10 == 0
                rlPrune(e)
        e.prevC := c
        done := true
    done

rlFeed(Eng e, float h1, float h2, int h3, float h4, float h5, float h6) =>
    if e.on
        rlStep(e, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6)
    e.n

[lvq11, lvq12, lvq13, lvq14, lvq15, lvq16] = f_rlReq("5",   q1)
[lvq21, lvq22, lvq23, lvq24, lvq25, lvq26] = f_rlReq("15",  q2)
[lvq31, lvq32, lvq33, lvq34, lvq35, lvq36] = f_rlReq("30",  q3)
[lvq41, lvq42, lvq43, lvq44, lvq45, lvq46] = f_rlReq("60",  q4)
[lvq51, lvq52, lvq53, lvq54, lvq55, lvq56] = f_rlReq("240", q5)
[lvq61, lvq62, lvq63, lvq64, lvq65, lvq66] = f_rlReq("D",   q6)

rlFeed(engs.get(0), lvq11, lvq12, lvq13, lvq14, lvq15, lvq16)
rlFeed(engs.get(1), lvq21, lvq22, lvq23, lvq24, lvq25, lvq26)
rlFeed(engs.get(2), lvq31, lvq32, lvq33, lvq34, lvq35, lvq36)
rlFeed(engs.get(3), lvq41, lvq42, lvq43, lvq44, lvq45, lvq46)
rlFeed(engs.get(4), lvq51, lvq52, lvq53, lvq54, lvq55, lvq56)
rlFeed(engs.get(5), lvq61, lvq62, lvq63, lvq64, lvq65, lvq66)

TL_MAXP = 20
tlLive  = tlMode == "Live (updates each candle)"
tlTriOnly = tlStyle == "Triangles only"
tlBoth    = tlStyle == "Triangles + channel"
tlChan    = tlStyle == "Channel" or tlBoth
tlAllowTri = tlTriOnly or tlBoth
tlApexMax = tlConvS == "Strict" ? 80 : tlConvS == "Loose" ? 400 : 200
tlFlatX   = tlConvS == "Strict" ? 1.5 : tlConvS == "Loose" ? 3.0 : 2.0
tlLook  = rlBars(cSec)
tlTol   = atr14 * 0.35

var array<float> tlHY = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   tlHX = array.new<int>()
var array<float> tlLY = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   tlLX = array.new<int>()

tlPH = ta.pivothigh(high, tlPiv, tlPiv)
tlPL = ta.pivotlow(low, tlPiv, tlPiv)
if mTL and not na(tlPH)
    tlHY.push(tlPH)
    tlHX.push(bar_index - tlPiv)
if mTL and not na(tlPL)
    tlLY.push(tlPL)
    tlLX.push(bar_index - tlPiv)
while tlHX.size() > 0 and (bar_index - tlHX.get(0) > tlLook or tlHX.size() > TL_MAXP)
    tlHX.shift()
    tlHY.shift()
while tlLX.size() > 0 and (bar_index - tlLX.get(0) > tlLook or tlLX.size() > TL_MAXP)
    tlLX.shift()
    tlLY.shift()

tlFit(array<float> Y, array<int> X, int side, float tol, int upto) =>
    float bSl = na
    float bIc = na
    int   bX0 = na
    int   bT  = 0
    float best = 0.0
    int n = Y.size()
    if n >= 2
        for i = 0 to n - 2
            if X.get(i) <= upto
                for j = i + 1 to n - 1
                    int x1 = X.get(i)
                    int x2 = X.get(j)
                    if x2 > x1 and x2 <= upto
                        float y1 = Y.get(i)
                        float y2 = Y.get(j)
                        float sl = (y2 - y1) / (x2 - x1)
                        bool  ok = true
                        int   tch = 0
                        for k = 0 to n - 1
                            if X.get(k) <= upto
                                float d = Y.get(k) - (y1 + sl * (X.get(k) - x1))
                                if side == 1 and d < -tol
                                    ok := false
                                    break
                                if side == -1 and d > tol
                                    ok := false
                                    break
                                if math.abs(d) <= tol
                                    tch += 1
                        if ok and tch >= tlMinT
                            float rec = 1.0 - math.min((upto - x2) / math.max(float(tlLook), 1.0), 1.0)
                            float sc  = tch + rec * 2.0
                            if sc > best
                                best := sc
                                bSl  := sl
                                bIc  := y1 - sl * x1
                                bX0  := x1
                                bT   := tch
    [bSl, bIc, bX0, bT]

tlWidth(array<float> Y, array<int> X, float sl, float ic, int x0, int side, int upto) =>
    float w = 0.0
    int n = Y.size()
    if n > 0 and not na(sl)
        for k = 0 to n - 1
            if X.get(k) >= x0 and X.get(k) <= upto
                float d = (Y.get(k) - (ic + sl * X.get(k))) * side
                w := math.max(w, d)
    w

var float tlUpSl = na
var float tlUpIc = na
var int   tlUpX0 = na
var int   tlUpT  = 0
var float tlUpW  = 0.0
var float tlDnSl = na
var float tlDnIc = na
var int   tlDnX0 = na
var int   tlDnT  = 0
var float tlDnW  = 0.0
var float tlRgSl = na
var float tlRgIc = na
var float tlRgSd = na
var int   tlRgX0 = na
var string tlPat = ""
var bool   tlConv = false
var bool  tlPend = true

tlRegress(int upto, int len) =>
    float sl = na
    float ic = na
    float sd = na
    int   x0 = math.max(upto - len + 1, 0)
    int   n  = upto - x0 + 1
    if n >= 20
        float sx = 0.0
        float sy = 0.0
        float sxy = 0.0
        float sxx = 0.0
        for b = x0 to upto
            float y = close[bar_index - b]
            sx  += b
            sy  += y
            sxy += b * y
            sxx += b * b
        float den = n * sxx - sx * sx
        if den != 0
            sl := (n * sxy - sx * sy) / den
            ic := (sy - sl * sx) / n
            float ss = 0.0
            for b = x0 to upto
                float d = close[bar_index - b] - (ic + sl * b)
                ss += d * d
            sd := math.sqrt(ss / n)
    [sl, ic, sd, x0]

tlPattern(float us, float ui, int ux, float ds, float di, int dx, int upto) =>
    bool hasU = not na(us)
    bool hasD = not na(ds)
    bool flatU = hasU and math.abs(us) * math.max(upto - ux, 1) < tlTol * tlFlatX
    bool flatD = hasD and math.abs(ds) * math.max(upto - dx, 1) < tlTol * tlFlatX
    float apexAhead = na
    if hasU and hasD and us != ds
        apexAhead := (di - ui) / (us - ds) - upto
    bool conv = not na(apexAhead) and apexAhead > 0 and apexAhead <= tlApexMax
    string r = hasU and hasD ? (conv ? (flatD and us > 0 ? "ascending triangle" : flatU and ds < 0 ? "descending triangle" : us > 0 and ds < 0 ? "symmetrical triangle" : us > 0 and ds > 0 ? "rising wedge" : us < 0 and ds < 0 ? "falling wedge" : "converging") : flatU and flatD ? "range" : us > 0 and ds > 0 ? "rising channel" : us < 0 and ds < 0 ? "falling channel" : "expanding") : hasU ? (flatU ? "flat support" : us > 0 ? "rising support" : "falling support") : hasD ? (flatD ? "flat resistance" : ds < 0 ? "falling resistance" : "rising resistance") : ""
    [r, conv]

if mTL and (intra ? newDay : wRoll)
    tlPend := true

var array<line>     lnArr = array.new<line>()
var array<label>    lblArr = array.new<label>()
var array<line>     tlLn  = array.new<line>()
var array<linefill> tlFl  = array.new<linefill>()
var int    rlShown = 0
var string rlNames = ""

draw(float v, string txt, color c, int wdt, int transp, int fromBar, int sty) =>
    bool made = false
    if not na(v)
        lnArr.push(line.new(math.max(fromBar, bar_index - MAXBACK), v, bar_index + LBL_OFF, v, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(c, transp), width = wdt, style = sty == 1 ? line.style_dashed : line.style_solid))
        if showLbls
            lblArr.push(label.new(bar_index + LBL_OFF, v, txt, xloc = xloc.bar_index, style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(c, 85), textcolor = c, size = size.tiny))
        made := true
    made

if (mSR or mTL) and barstate.islast
    while lnArr.size() > 0
        line.delete(lnArr.pop())
    while lblArr.size() > 0
        label.delete(lblArr.pop())

    rlShown := 0
    rlNames := ""
    if mSR
        for e in engs
            if e.on
                rlNames := rlNames + e.name + " "
                array<Lvl>   pool = e.pool
                array<int>   uI = array.new<int>()
                array<float> uS = array.new<float>()
                array<int>   dI = array.new<int>()
                array<float> dS = array.new<float>()
                int np = pool.size()
                if np > 0
                    for i = 0 to np - 1
                        Lvl L0 = pool.get(i)
                        if L0.hits >= rlMinT and (not rlFlipOnly or rlIsFlip(L0)) and near(L0.px, fD)
                            if L0.px > close
                                uI.push(i)
                                uS.push(rlScore(L0, e))
                            else
                                dI.push(i)
                                dS.push(rlScore(L0, e))
                if uI.size() > 0
                    array<int> ou = uS.sort_indices(order.descending)
                    for k = 0 to math.min(rlPer, ou.size()) - 1
                        Lvl L0 = pool.get(uI.get(ou.get(k)))
                        bool fl = rlIsFlip(L0)
                        bool rs = L0.hiHits >= L0.loHits
                        draw(L0.px, e.name + (fl ? "◆" : rs ? "▽" : "△") + str.tostring(L0.hits), e.col, fl ? 2 : 1, fl ? 0 : 25, L0.firstB, 0)
                        rlShown += 1
                if dI.size() > 0
                    array<int> od = dS.sort_indices(order.descending)
                    for k = 0 to math.min(rlPer, od.size()) - 1
                        Lvl L0 = pool.get(dI.get(od.get(k)))
                        bool fl = rlIsFlip(L0)
                        bool rs = L0.hiHits >= L0.loHits
                        draw(L0.px, e.name + (fl ? "◆" : rs ? "▽" : "△") + str.tostring(L0.hits), e.col, fl ? 2 : 1, fl ? 0 : 25, L0.firstB, 0)
                        rlShown += 1

    while tlLn.size() > 0
        line.delete(tlLn.pop())
    while tlFl.size() > 0
        linefill.delete(tlFl.pop())

    if mTL
        if tlLive or tlPend
            int upto = tlLive ? bar_index : math.max((intra ? dStart : wStart) - 1, 0)
            [us, ui, ux, ut] = tlFit(tlLY, tlLX, 1, tlTol, upto)
            [ds, di, dx, dt] = tlFit(tlHY, tlHX, -1, tlTol, upto)
            tlUpSl := us
            tlUpIc := ui
            tlUpX0 := ux
            tlUpT  := ut
            tlDnSl := ds
            tlDnIc := di
            tlDnX0 := dx
            tlDnT  := dt
            tlUpW  := na(us) ? 0.0 : tlWidth(tlHY, tlHX, us, ui, ux, 1, upto)
            tlDnW  := na(ds) ? 0.0 : tlWidth(tlLY, tlLX, ds, di, dx, -1, upto)
            [pat, cnv] = tlPattern(us, ui, ux, ds, di, dx, upto)
            tlPat  := pat
            tlConv := cnv
            tlRgSl := na
            tlRgIc := na
            tlRgSd := na
            if tlReg and na(us) and na(ds)
                tlConv := false
                [rs, ri, rd, rx] = tlRegress(upto, tlLook)
                tlRgSl := rs
                tlRgIc := ri
                tlRgSd := rd
                tlRgX0 := rx
                tlPat  := na(rs) ? "" : "regression"
            tlPend := false

        bool isTri = tlConv and tlAllowTri
        int  xApex = na
        if isTri and not na(tlUpSl) and not na(tlDnSl) and tlUpSl != tlDnSl
            float ax = (tlDnIc - tlUpIc) / (tlUpSl - tlDnSl)
            if ax > math.max(tlUpX0, tlDnX0) and ax < bar_index + 300
                xApex := int(ax)
        bool triDraw  = isTri and not na(xApex) and tlTriOnly
        bool triExtra = isTri and not na(xApex) and tlBoth
        int xR = triDraw ? xApex : bar_index + tlExt
        line triUp = na
        line triDn = na
        bool drawLines = not tlTriOnly or triDraw
        if not na(tlUpSl) and drawLines
            float y1 = tlUpIc + tlUpSl * tlUpX0
            float y2 = tlUpIc + tlUpSl * xR
            line la = line.new(tlUpX0, y1, xR, y2, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = tlUpC, width = 2)
            tlLn.push(la)
            triUp := la
            if tlChan and tlUpW > 0
                line lb = line.new(tlUpX0, y1 + tlUpW, xR, y2 + tlUpW, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = tlUpC, width = 2)
                tlLn.push(lb)
                tlLn.push(line.new(tlUpX0, y1 + tlUpW * 0.5, xR, y2 + tlUpW * 0.5, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(tlUpC, 45), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed))
                if tlFill
                    tlFl.push(linefill.new(la, lb, color.new(tlUpC, 93)))
            if showLbls
                lblArr.push(label.new(xR, y2, "TL▲" + str.tostring(tlUpT), xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(tlUpC, 85), textcolor = tlUpC, size = size.tiny))
        if not na(tlDnSl) and drawLines
            float y1 = tlDnIc + tlDnSl * tlDnX0
            float y2 = tlDnIc + tlDnSl * xR
            line la = line.new(tlDnX0, y1, xR, y2, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = tlDnC, width = 2)
            tlLn.push(la)
            triDn := la
            if tlChan and tlDnW > 0
                line lb = line.new(tlDnX0, y1 - tlDnW, xR, y2 - tlDnW, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = tlDnC, width = 2)
                tlLn.push(lb)
                tlLn.push(line.new(tlDnX0, y1 - tlDnW * 0.5, xR, y2 - tlDnW * 0.5, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(tlDnC, 45), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed))
                if tlFill
                    tlFl.push(linefill.new(la, lb, color.new(tlDnC, 93)))
            if showLbls
                lblArr.push(label.new(xR, y2, "TL▼" + str.tostring(tlDnT), xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(tlDnC, 85), textcolor = tlDnC, size = size.tiny))
        if triExtra
            line ea = line.new(tlUpX0, tlUpIc + tlUpSl * tlUpX0, xApex, tlUpIc + tlUpSl * xApex, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = tlUpC, width = 1)
            line eb = line.new(tlDnX0, tlDnIc + tlDnSl * tlDnX0, xApex, tlDnIc + tlDnSl * xApex, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = tlDnC, width = 1)
            tlLn.push(ea)
            tlLn.push(eb)
            if tlFill
                tlFl.push(linefill.new(ea, eb, color.new(tlPat == "descending triangle" or tlPat == "falling wedge" ? tlDnC : tlUpC, 92)))
        if (triDraw or triExtra) and (triExtra or (not na(triUp) and not na(triDn)))
            if triDraw and tlFill and not na(triUp) and not na(triDn)
                tlFl.push(linefill.new(triUp, triDn, color.new(tlPat == "descending triangle" or tlPat == "falling wedge" ? tlDnC : tlUpC, 92)))
            float apexY = tlUpIc + tlUpSl * xApex
            tlLn.push(line.new(xApex, apexY - atr14, xApex, apexY + atr14, xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                 color = color.new(color.gray, 40), width = 1, style = line.style_dotted))
            if showLbls
                color pc = tlPat == "descending triangle" or tlPat == "falling wedge" ? tlDnC : tlUpC
                lblArr.push(label.new(xApex, apexY, tlPat, xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(pc, 85), textcolor = pc, size = size.tiny))
        if na(tlUpSl) and na(tlDnSl) and not na(tlRgSl) and not na(tlRgSd) and not tlTriOnly
            color rc = tlRgSl >= 0 ? tlUpC : tlDnC
            float m1 = tlRgIc + tlRgSl * tlRgX0
            float m2 = tlRgIc + tlRgSl * xR
            float bw = tlRgSd * 2.0
            line ra = line.new(tlRgX0, m1 + bw, xR, m2 + bw, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = rc, width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
            line rb = line.new(tlRgX0, m1 - bw, xR, m2 - bw, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = rc, width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
            tlLn.push(ra)
            tlLn.push(rb)
            tlLn.push(line.new(tlRgX0, m1, xR, m2, xloc = xloc.bar_index, color = color.new(rc, 45), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed))
            if tlFill
                tlFl.push(linefill.new(ra, rb, color.new(rc, 94)))
            if showLbls
                lblArr.push(label.new(xR, m2 + bw, "REG", xloc = xloc.bar_index,
                     style = label.style_label_left, color = color.new(rc, 85), textcolor = rc, size = size.tiny))

var table pn = table.new(position.middle_left, 2, 10, border_width = 1, frame_width = 1, frame_color = color.new(color.gray, 45))
if showPnl and barstate.islast
    sz2 = size.small
    bgLum  = 0.299 * color.r(chart.bg_color) + 0.587 * color.g(chart.bg_color) + 0.114 * color.b(chart.bg_color)
    lightC = bgLum > 128
    anyIn  = srIn or trPos
    useEnt = srIn ? dEnt : trEnt
    useStp = srIn ? dStp : trStop
    opnPts = (srIn  and not na(dEnt)   ? close - dEnt   : 0.0) + (trPos and not na(trEnt) ? close - trEnt : 0.0)
    rskPts = (srIn  and not na(dEnt)   and not na(dStp)    ? dEnt   - dStp   : 0.0) + (trPos and not na(trEnt) and not na(trStop) ? trEnt - trStop : 0.0)
    mv  = anyIn ? opnPts : na
    mp  = anyIn and agree == 1 and not na(useEnt) and useEnt > 0 ? (close - useEnt) / useEnt * 100 : na
    rup   = anyIn ? opnPts * lotSz : na
    riskR = anyIn ? rskPts * lotSz : slp * lotSz
    lotTxt = agree > 1 ? "  ×" + str.tostring(agree) + " lots" : ""
    good = not na(mv) and mv >= 0
    vb = not anyIn ? (lightC ? color.new(#dadce0, 0) : color.new(#374151, 25)) : good ? (lightC ? color.new(#d7f2e3, 0) : color.new(#065f46, 12)) : (lightC ? color.new(#fbdcdc, 0) : color.new(#7f1d1d, 12))
    vt = not anyIn ? (lightC ? color.new(#5f6368, 0) : color.new(color.white, 35)) : good ? (lightC ? #0b6b3a : #6ee7b7) : (lightC ? #a11414 : #fca5a5)
    lb = lightC ? color.new(#e8eaed, 0) : color.new(#101826, 0)
    lt = lightC ? color.new(#3c4043, 0) : color.new(color.white, 30)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 0, "STRIKE CORE", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lightC ? color.black : color.white, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 0, (isCE ? "CALL" : "PUT") + " ×" + str.tostring(lotSz) + "  ·  " + str.tostring(tp1p, "#") + " / " + str.tostring(slp, "#"), bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 1, "Engines", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 1, (useSR ? "①" : "·") + (useTR ? "②" : "·") + "  " + dots, bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 2, "Status", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 2, agree >= 2 ? "IN · BOTH ENGINES" : srIn ? "IN · SR" : trPos ? "IN · TR" : "FLAT", bgcolor = vb, text_color = vt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 3, "Entry", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 3, anyIn ? str.tostring(useEnt, "#.##") : "—", bgcolor = vb, text_color = vt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 4, "Move", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 4, na(mv) ? "—" : (mv >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(mv, "#.##") + (na(mp) ? "" : "  (" + str.tostring(mp, "#.#") + "%)"), bgcolor = vb, text_color = vt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 5, "P&L" + lotTxt, bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 5, na(rup) ? "—" : (rup >= 0 ? "+₹" : "-₹") + str.tostring(math.abs(rup), "#,###"), bgcolor = vb, text_color = vt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 6, "Targets", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    lvlTxt = "T1 " + str.tostring(tp1p, "#") + " · SL " + str.tostring(slp, "#")
    rungTxt = "T1 " + str.tostring(useEnt + tp1p, format.mintick) + "  ·  SL " + str.tostring(useStp, format.mintick)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 6, anyIn ? rungTxt : lvlTxt, bgcolor = vb, text_color = vt, text_size = sz2)
    dayR  = dayPts * lotSz
    dayC  = dayPts > 0 ? (lightC ? #0b6b3a : colUp) : dayPts < 0 ? (lightC ? #a11414 : colDn) : lt
    capUse = capShared ? dayOpens : math.max(srDay, trDay)
    capTxt = maxN > 99999 ? "" : "  ·  " + str.tostring(capUse) + "/" + str.tostring(maxN) + (capShared ? "" : " each")
    table.cell(pn, 0, 7, "Today" + capTxt, bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    dayOth = math.max(dayN - dayT1 - daySL - agree, 0)
    dayTxt = "T1 " + str.tostring(dayT1) + " · SL " + str.tostring(daySL) + (dayOth > 0 ? " · flat " + str.tostring(dayOth) : "")
    table.cell(pn, 1, 7, dayN == 0 ? "no trades yet" : dayTxt + "   " + (dayR >= 0 ? "+₹" : "-₹") + str.tostring(math.abs(dayR), "#,###"), bgcolor = lb, text_color = dayC, text_size = sz2)
    if showDiag
        table.cell(pn, 0, 9, "Raw / taken", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
        table.cell(pn, 1, 9, str.tostring(rawA) + "/" + str.tostring(takA) + "  " + str.tostring(rawB) + "/" + str.tostring(takB), bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2)
    table.cell(pn, 0, 8, "Stop", bgcolor = lb, text_color = lt, text_size = sz2, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(pn, 1, 8, anyIn ? str.tostring(useStp, "#.##") + "   -₹" + str.tostring(riskR, "#,###") : "—", bgcolor = vb, text_color = vt, text_size = sz2)

gA = "Alerts"
alertMsg = input.string("{symbol} {engine}#{trade} {action} {price} · T1 {t1} · SL {sl} · {lots} qty", "Alert message", group = gA, tooltip = "⚠ Placeholders: {symbol} {engine} {trade} {action} {price} {t1} {sl} {lots} {agree}\n\n{engine} is SR or TR and {trade} is the number printed beside the mark on the chart, so an exit alert can be matched to the entry alert it closes. Without both, two engines entering on one bar send two identical messages.\n\n{price} on an EXIT is the price the trade actually ended at — the stop on a stop, the target on a target — not the bar's close.\n\n{t2} still resolves if you use it, but it is not an exit: it is the level the move would have to reach for the second hollow mark to print.")

f_msg(string act, float px, string eng, int no) =>
    bool isEntry = act == "BUY"
    m = alertMsg
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{symbol}", syminfo.ticker)
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{action}", act)
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{engine}", eng)
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{trade}",  str.tostring(no))
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{price}",  str.tostring(px, format.mintick))
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{t1}",     isEntry ? str.tostring(px + tp1p, format.mintick) : "-")
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{t2}",     not isEntry ? "-" : str.tostring(px + tp2p, format.mintick))
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{sl}",     isEntry ? str.tostring(math.max(px - slp, syminfo.mintick), format.mintick) : "-")
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{lots}",   str.tostring(lotSz))
    m := str.replace_all(m, "{agree}",  str.tostring(agree))
    m

alertcondition(justIn, "Strike Rate · Entry", "{{ticker}}")
alertcondition(justOut, "Strike Rate · Exit", "{{ticker}}")
alertcondition(trSigU, "SR Trend · Entry", "{{ticker}}")
trExitAlert = trExit
alertcondition(trExitAlert, "SR Trend · Exit", "{{ticker}}")
alertcondition(staleNow, "Stale trade", "{{ticker}}")
if staleNow
    alert(f_msg("STALE", close, "--", 0), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if justIn
    alert(f_msg("BUY", close, "SR", srNo), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if justOut
    alert(f_msg("EXIT", srPxA, "SR", srNo), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if trSigU
    alert(f_msg("BUY", close, "TR", trNo), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
if trExitAlert
    alert(f_msg("EXIT", nz(trOut, close), "TR", trNo), alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
